==Description==
To use this template, copy the following code and fill in the appropriate fields.

==Syntax==
<pre>{{infobox box
 | title         = 
 | image         = [e.g. "Example.jpg"]
 | author        = 
 | illustrator   = 
 | datePublished = 
 | publisher     = 
 | previous      = 
 | next          = 
}}</pre>

==Sample output==
{{infobox book
 | title         = The Adventures of Flower
 | image         = Example.jpg
 | author        = Alice
 | illustrator   = Bob
 | datePublished = April 1928
 | publisher     = Arthur's
 | previous      = Book One
 | next          = Book Three
}}
